{"id":"afirmar","lemma":"afirmar","pos":"verb","rank":4146,"glosses":["to state, assert"],"ipa":"/afiɾˈmaɾ/","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"afirmo","2s":"afirmas","3s":"afirma","1p":"afirmamos","2p":"afirmáis","3p":"afirman"},"imperfect":{"1s":"afirmaba","2s":"afirmabas","3s":"afirmaba","1p":"afirmábamos","2p":"afirmabais","3p":"afirmaban"},"preterite":{"1s":"afirmé","2s":"afirmaste","3s":"afirmó","1p":"afirmamos","2p":"afirmasteis","3p":"afirmaron"},"future":{"1s":"afirmaré","2s":"afirmarás","3s":"afirmará","1p":"afirmaremos","2p":"afirmaréis","3p":"afirmarán"},"conditional":{"1s":"afirmaría","2s":"afirmarías","3s":"afirmaría","1p":"afirmaríamos","2p":"afirmaríais","3p":"afirmarían"}},"subjunctive":{"present":{"1s":"afirme","2s":"afirmes","3s":"afirme","1p":"afirmemos","2p":"afirméis","3p":"afirmen"},"imperfect":{"1s":"afirmara","2s":"afirmaras","3s":"afirmara","1p":"afirmáramos","2p":"afirmarais","3p":"afirmaran"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"afirma","3s":"afirme","1p":"afirmemos","2p":"afirmad","3p":"afirmen"},"negative":{"2s":"afirmes","3s":"afirme","1p":"afirmemos","2p":"afirméis","3p":"afirmen"}}},"nonFinite":{"gerund":"afirmando","participle":"afirmado"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-afirmar.wav","examples":[{"text":"Estás simplemente afirmando lo obvio.","en":"You're just stating the obvious.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/514757","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"simply"},null,{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"obvious"}]},{"text":"Él afirma que no sabe nada acerca de ella.","en":"He claims he knows nothing about her.","words":[{"g":"he"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"nothing"},null,null,{"g":"she"}],"phrases":[[6,8,"about, concerning"]]},{"text":"Este producto afirma que ayuda a perder peso.","en":"This product claims to help you lose weight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693106","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"product"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"help, aid"},{"g":"to"},null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"to lose weight"]]},{"text":"Tom afirma que fue abducido por los extraterrestres.","en":"Tom claims he was abducted by aliens.","words":[null,null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"to abduce, to abduct","l":"abducir"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"extraterrestrial","l":"extraterrestre"}]},{"text":"Tom y Mary afirman que ellos nunca se mienten el uno al otro.","en":"Tom and Mary claim that they never lie to each other.","words":[null,{"g":"and"},null,null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"never"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to mention, name","l":"mentar"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[9,13,"each other"]]}]}